      "widgets_values": [
        "# ⚠️ NOTE · Saving\n\nThis workflow **overwrites the original `.json` files** in the image folder (in-place)!\n➡️ Make a **backup** of the dataset folder first.\n\n**Steps:**\n1. `Insert Dataset Image Location` = folder with images **and** `.json` (captions live in the `.json`; the `.txt` files are empty).\n2. Run → in the **Dataset Reviewer**, drag boxes / edit text → **\"Apply BBox edits\"**.\n3. Run again → *Override Text Files* writes the captions back as `.json`.\n\nBBox format: `yxyx_normalized`. Saves on **every** run (even without changes)."
